        method        "DERIVED from a fit: omega = -log10(Psat(0.7 Tc)/Pc) - 1 from the Antoine the vapour-pressure pipeline fitted (data/curation/components/diethyleneGlycolMonohexylEther) and the measured Tc, Pc; 0.7 Tc = 507.12 K, EXTRAPOLATED +34.0 K beyond the fitted range (402.96-473.15 K)";
